- Never allow archived→active transition — always duplicate first
- Never delete without Modal confirmation
- Never expose quizzes across shops — always filter by session.shop
- Never skip the empty state — every list needs it
- Never create a quiz without immediately linking to question builder
- Never use `router.push` — use Polaris `url` prop or App Bridge navigate
- Never leave a quiz with zero result pages — always create a default one

