- [ ] All 8 question types have their default settings object
- [ ] Position recompaction runs after delete (no gaps)
- [ ] Reorder uses `$transaction` for atomicity
- [ ] image-choice upload uses Shopify stagedUploadsCreate
- [ ] Answer productTags stored as valid JSON array string
