- [ ] Cycle detection runs before quiz activation (status → active)
- [ ] evaluateConditions is a pure function (no side effects)
- [ ] getNextQuestionId handles quiz completion (returns null)
- [ ] tag-add rules feed into recommendation-engine tag pool
